1576 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Garlic\054 IllIllIll llc\nChief Product Designer\054 Jan 2025 \023 \036\nGarlic is the foodie app for your friends\056 No garbo spam from gmaps or SusieQ on yelp\056 People you trust\054 in a place that\047s fun\056 Create lists for yourself and others\054 keep track of tasty dishes\054 and if you\047re crazy like me\054 connect your openclaw ai agent to discover yumyum tasty dishes\056\nWe founded Garlic to meet a need we saw\056 I built the design and system to return to having fun on the internet\054 and not a bland black\055and\055white sinkhole\056 Rate places with emoji\054 not numbers\054 that\047s not how taste works\056 Friend\055only \050mutuals\051 so you can trust every review and comment you see\056 Colorful\054 perky UI and interactions so the app is as enjoying to use as much as it is useful\056\nWith help from my cuz claude\054 I also built all the new features in the native app last year\072 front\055end\054 back\055end\054 and even having calls with Apple for approvals\056 React Android Notifications Expo Supabase Postgres Triggers Edge\055Functions VSCode yikes\056 )
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1577 0 R
     /Pg 1570 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

