1578 0 obj
  << /ActualText (FreshCut\nFounding Designer\054 Aug 2021 \023 Aug 2024\nAs the founding designer\054 worked with our CEO\054 Head of Product\054 and Head of Engineering to make the app for the next generation of gamers\056 FreshCut lets you learn\054 share\054 and connect over trending games\054 whatever platform they may be on\056 Features included\072 a web3 wallet \050high security\054 transfers\054 deposits\054 and now defunct\051\054 item inventory \050for cosmetics purchases\051\054 a full featured quests system\054 video editor\054 and of course the feed \046 comments with integrated tipping\056 Also illustrated the default pixel Moji set\054 and pixel app icons\054 among many\054 many other projects\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 1579 0 R
     /Pg 1570 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

