1580 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Reddit\nSenior UX Designer\054 Mar 2016 \023 July 2020\nLead and collaborated cross\055functionally with product and engineering to define\054 explore\054 converge\054 and iterate designs to modernize Reddit with a user\055centric approach\056 Executed clear and concise user journeys\054 wireframes\054 mockups\054 interactive prototypes\054 and specs while advocating for usability and simple\054 elegant design\056 Created these experiences for the iOS app\054 Android app\054 video\054 consumer monetization\054 live streaming\054 April Fools\054 and more\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 1581 0 R
     /Pg 1570 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
