  << /ActualText (Achievers\nMobile Product Designer\054 Oct 2013 \023 Mar 2016\nOwned design for iOS and Android apps from definition to shipping\056 Worked closely and built strong relationships with an agile team\054 lead design studios for project kick\055offs\056 Led and gave critical feedback with designers to raise the bar on our designs\056)
